  "text": "`config.status' instantiates files and other configuration actions\nfrom templates according to the current configuration.  Unless the files\nand actions are specified as TAGs, all are instantiated by default.\n\nUsage: /src/config.status [OPTION]... [TAG]...\n\n  -h, --help       print this help, then exit\n  -V, --version    print version number and configuration settings, then exit\n      --config     print configuration, then exit\n  -q, --quiet, --silent\n                   do not print progress messages\n  -d, --debug      don't remove temporary files\n      --recheck    update config.status by reconfiguring in the same conditions\n      --file=FILE[:TEMPLATE]\n                   instantiate the configuration file FILE\n\nConfiguration files:\n Makefile yara.pc\n\nConfiguration commands:\n depfiles libtool\n\nReport bugs to <vmalvarez@virustotal.com>.\n"
